The source has been substantially rewritten in C: Android, libdrm, drawing,
input, resource decoding, font and recovery dependencies have been removed.
Original TWRP and grom-init repositories are not modified.

third_party/drm/drm.h and drm_mode.h are Linux DRM UAPI headers from the
host libdrm header package. Their original permissive licenses are retained
in each file. No libdrm library is linked.

third_party/lvgl-9.4.0-core.tar.gz contains unmodified LVGL v9.4.0 src/,
lvgl.h, lvgl_private.h, lv_version.h and LICENCE.txt (MIT).
Source: https://github.com/lvgl/lvgl/releases/tag/v9.4.0
